  "briefing": [
    "Both floor keys down opens the gate. The pad behind the gate mutes the lasers. The switch is past the lasers.",
    "That is four jobs and you own three cassettes. The sentry shoots whoever stands nearest, once every two bars.",
    "Getting shot does not stop the tape. A dead take keeps recording, and none of it counts unless a later take keeps her alive."
  ],
